    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Live AI: not connected",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "No live model credential has been configured. Model latency, token usage, model failure rate, extraction accuracy and estimated AI cost are **unavailable**. Rule-based recommendations are explicitly labeled fallback; zero commercial AI cost is not asserted."
